  <h1>IHDM Manifesto</h1>
  <p>The Integrated Human Development Model (IHDM) is a framework to nurture cognitive clarity, emotional balance, identity awareness, and ethical social integration. It is open to study, critique, and refinement.</p>

  <h2>Key Principles</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Clarity before belief</li>
    <li>Awareness before reaction</li>
    <li>Evidence before claim</li>
    <li>Dialogue before division</li>
    <li>Balance before extremism</li>
    <li>Identity with humility</li>
    <li>Growth through critique</li>
    <li>Science with openness</li>
    <li>Spirituality without dogma</li>
    <li>Development as a lifelong process</li>
  </ul>

